  "body": "CoAkka public artifact boundary for the 1.3.1 runtime train.\n\nPrimary downloads are attached to this GitHub Release and also live in this repository under their published paths:\n\n- Logger JVM, Python, Node.js, Bun, Electron, Go, C#, Rust connectors: `logger/{jvm,python,node,bun,electron,go,csharp,rust}/releases/`\n- Logger Tauri, Mojo, and Zig source packages: `logger/{tauri,mojo,zig}/releases/`\n- Logger native C/C++ package: `logger/native/releases/1.2.1+f50756ebff0d/`\n- Runtime native core: `runtime/native/releases/1.3.1+bda2ef5/`\n- Runtime JVM connector: `runtime/jvm/releases/1.3.1+bda2ef5-0a0aa76/`\n- Runtime Python, Node.js, Go, C#, Rust connectors: `runtime/{python,node,go,csharp,rust}/releases/1.3.1+bda2ef5-0a0aa76/`\n- Runtime Bun connector: `runtime/bun/releases/1.3.1+bda2ef5-247df1b/`\n- Runtime Electron connector: `runtime/electron/releases/1.3.1+bda2ef5-4e0cab0/`\n- Runtime Mojo and Zig source packages: `runtime/{mojo,zig}/releases/1.3.1+bda2ef5-0a0aa76/`\n- Runtime Tauri intent source package: `runtime/tauri/releases/1.3.1+bda2ef5-247df1b/`\n- Spring Boot and Quarkus adapters: `maven/coakka/{spring,quarkus}/`\n- CoAkka Runtime Client CLI: `cli/releases/1.3.1+2215b0f/`\n- CoAkka Runtime Client Docker Linux bundle: `demo/coakka-client/releases/1.3.1+2215b0f/`\n- CoAkka Runtime Inspect: `runtime-inspect/native/releases/1.3.1+4ce41f19/` for Linux and `1.3.1+d7ab7fa` for macOS/Windows\n\nAttached assets include all 38 public artifact files listed by `artifacts/public-artifacts.tsv`, plus the manifest itself. Use the manifest SHA256 values to verify downloads.\n\nPinned source/provenance tags:\n\n- `coakkaCoreNativeDev`: `coakka-runtime-core-v1.3.1-bda2ef5`, `coakka-runtime-client-v1.3.1-2215b0f`, `coakka-runtime-inspect-v1.3.1-4ce41f19`\n- `coakkaJVMConnector`: `coakka-runtime-connector-v1.3.1-bda2ef5-0a0aa76`, `coakka-runtime-connector-v1.3.1-bda2ef5-247df1b`, plus Electron runtime source `4e0cab0`, Bun logger source `6fdcc69`, and Tauri/Electron logger source `3e8a6ae`\n- `coakka-samples`: `coakka-samples-runtime-v1.3.1`, with follow-up sample commits for Bun/Tauri/Electron runtime lanes and logger desktop lanes\n\nVerification boundary:\n\n- Public artifact manifest SHA256: `1d028f5c25ed13e3a7ee6023ba79301964067fb7010d2899ab39bcf730243246`\n- Release boundary note: `docs/releases/2026-07-18-public-release-boundary-1.3.1.md`\n- Bun/Tauri runtime release note: `docs/releases/2026-07-23-runtime-bun-tauri-1.3.1-247df1b.md`\n- Electron runtime release note: `docs/releases/2026-07-23-runtime-electron-1.3.1-4e0cab0.md`\n- Bun logger release note: `docs/releases/2026-07-23-logger-bun-1.2.1-6fdcc69.md`\n- Tauri/Electron logger release note: `docs/releases/2026-07-23-logger-tauri-electron-1.2.1-3e8a6ae.md`\n- Verified with `scripts/verify-public-surface.sh`, runtime intake checks, connector release train gates, clean-room `coakka-samples`, logger Bun/Electron packaged smokes, logger Tauri command smoke, runtime-client archive smoke, Docker Linux bundle smoke, runtime-inspect Docker smoke, and Docker Hub multi-arch image inspection.\n\nDocker Hub image lane:\n\n- `docker.io/gabrielgun1983/runtime-base:1.3.1-bda2ef5-remote`\n- `docker.io/gabrielgun1983/sample-python-store:1.3.1-bda2ef5-0a0aa76-remote`\n- `docker.io/gabrielgun1983/sample-node-web:1.3.1-bda2ef5-0a0aa76-remote`\n- `docker.io/gabrielgun1983/coakka-runtime-inspect-sample:1.3.1-4ce41f19-remote` digest `sha256:0f69c5eb4eac4ea2c11c5123971a591bf67adb4d6c0f791283f3286d3aecca89`\n\nPost-release patch:\n\n- Public docs/scripts avoid exposing native implementation dependency names.\n- Native artifact linkage checks use a CoAkka/system allowlist and generic failure output.\n- Runtime-inspect Linux Docker image was rebuilt from self-contained public archives and repushed with the digest above.\n- Bun and Tauri runtime artifacts were refreshed on the 1.3.1 release page from connector source `247df1b`; public package paths and source text stay at the CoAkka boundary.\n- Electron runtime is published as a thin first-party connector bridge and renderer code only sends an intent to the main-process runtime boundary.\n- Bun logger is published as `coakka-logger-bun-1.2.1.tgz`; Bun consumers do not install package dependencies or third-party native runtime dependencies for the normal path.\n- Tauri logger is published as a Rust source package where WebView JavaScript sends log intents and Rust owns logger lifecycle.\n- Electron logger is published as a thin main-process logger intent bridge over the first-party Node logger package.",
